Q_s is EXACTLY pi^2 x rational (each value lands inside the S4 certified interval, confirming both).
Q_s/pi^2 = sum_{p,p'} eps_p eps_p' B2bar(w(p-p')): a positive-definite Bernoulli quadratic form on the
signed endpoint set. THM-729's open Q_s=O(diam) <=> this form is O(M) uniformly (Montgomery-Vaughan).
